    {
      "id": "ME01",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "from": "MainWindow / TitleBar / TitleToolBar.InitializeComponent",
      "to": "原资源路径与内容加载门",
      "behavior": "三个InitializeComponent均先读_contentLoaded，已加载则返回，否则先写true，再构造Relative URI并Application.LoadComponent(this,uri)。URI分别为mainwindow.xaml、appmainwindow/titlebar.xaml、appmainwindow/titletoolbar.xaml；两标题控件构造体直接调用各自InitializeComponent。所选MainWindow原BAML明确在BaseWindow.TitleBar内声明TitleBar，TitleBar又声明TitleToolBar。四份新离线解码BAML与既有本地资源逐字节相同；这将类型、资源和静态宿主声明接上，不代表真实活实例已创建或加载失败后自动重试。",
